    <briefdescription>
<para>Compile-time trait to detect whether a pack of tensor dimensions describes a square rank-2 tensor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Rest</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the pack of tensor dimensions</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Used to gate symmetry-exploiting code paths in numerical/automatic differentiation routines, which are only meaningful for a rank-2 tensor argument with equal dimensions (e.g. the right Cauchy-Green tensor). </para>
